{
  "_": [
    "james_bond_le on marty & jpsalas's 'BOND for VISUAL PINBALL X 10.7' 4.3 (bond.vpx,",
    "JP's Friday the 13th script re-themed): a scripted tribute on the 2022 007 LE's",
    "OWN playfield art, rocket ring, tank and jet pack magnet, so the LE is its card.",
    "Every object was placed against the rig's switch_xy/led_io drawing (table x * 459/952,",
    "y * 998/2228); the art lines up with the LED frame within a few px at the top and",
    "~20 px low at the bottom. Mechs the table lacks: left eject, rocket VUK + lock,",
    "jet pack motor, center lane diverter, control gate, back ramp and right return up",
    "posts (their coils are listed with no callback). The center 3-bank are STANDUPS",
    "here (no reset to do). The table's right scoop sinks into `scoop` and comes back",
    "out of `scoop1`, so it is a held switch plus PadScoopOut, not a saucer stack.",
    "The tribute's flippers only move while ITS game set bFlippersEnabled; PadLFlip and",
    "PadRFlip set it. B2SOff: the bridge replaces Controller, so a running B2S server",
    "would get every DOF call (B2SSetData) and stop the sling subs with an error.",
    "quiet_subs: its attract light shows; GI is left to its GIUpdateTimer (ball count)",
    "because the LE's GI LEDs have no names in led_io.txt."
  ],
